    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nindo maeca Merodak-baladan ma wod Baladan, m’ubimo mi Babeli oro waraga man giramia ni Hezekia; kum ewinjo nia naka kume lith, man nia kume kei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E anyong’a nego Hezekia ni kumgi, man enyutho igi ot mi piny pare ma pire tek, mola ma tar, ku mola ma kwar, man yath ma jwa jwa, ku mo ma pire tek, man ot ceke mi jamtho pare, ku gin ceke ma junwang’u i piny m’akana pare: gin moko mbe i ot pare, kadi iker pare ceke, ma Hezekia kunyutho igi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya ma jabila lund ubino bang’ ubimo ma Hezekia, man ewacu ire kumae, dhanu maeni wacu ang’o? man giai kani ma gibino ko i beng’i? E Hezekia wacu kumae, Giai i ng’om ma bor gibino i bang’a, cu i Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund ewacu kumae, Gineno ang’o i ot peri? E Hezekia loko lembe kumae, Gineno gin ceke ma ni i ot para: gin moko mbe i kind piny m’akana para ma k’anyutho igi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya lund uwacu ni Hezekia kumae, Winj lembe pa Yehova mir udul: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, nindo bebino, ma gin ceke ma gini i ot peri, ku gin ma kwaru ketho malu i kakanpiny cil tin, jubitero i Babeli: gin moko mbe ma bidong’, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
